# Play test of Camp Blackwater (CIPlay camp_blackwater, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The camp on the lake's west shore (3.5 m): the gate at -44 35, the mess hall at -36 41, cabin 1 at -40..-29.5 22..32.5,
# the archery shed at -44.5 22; the lake x -8..32 z 29..46; the old boathouse on its east shore (30-35 37-41.5); the fire
# lookout up the hill at 0 11 (ground 10.4 m, deck 16.9 m, its ladder on the south side).
island Camp Blackwater
offset -0.4374 -1.2402
expect step 0
expect title The Last Week of Summer
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 6
expect animals Goat 4
expect animals Turtle 2

# Off the jetty, up the road under the banner
walk -55 36 to -49 36 to -45.5 35 h=3.5
zone campgate
expect step 1

# The mess hall: the logbook, the pantry's honey; the footlocker in cabin 1 is padlocked
read Head counselor's logbook
expect step 2
open Camp pantry
expect story honey 1
expect step 3
open Counselor's footlocker
expect message padlocked

# The archery shed: the flare pistol
walk -44 33 to -46 27 to -43 24 h=3.6 below=5
open Archery shed box
expect story flaregun 1
expect step 4
# (the canoe dock's box, on the way round the lake)
open Dock box
expect step 5

# Round the lake's south shore to the old boathouse: the bait, the Ridge Bear, her last note
walk -46 27 to -44 34.5 to -28 34.6 to -14 34 to -11 31 to -6 26.5 to 10 24.5 to 25 25.5 to 33 27.5 to 35 34 h=3
zone boathouse
expect step 6
use baitpost
expect shown ridgebear
wait 2
kill Bear
expect step 7
read Dana's last note
expect step 8

# Up the trail to the fire lookout: its ladder, the deck, the flare - the ranger boat answers, the key
walk 33 27.5 to 25 25.5 to 10 24.5 to -6 26.5 to -4 20 to 0 13.5 to 3 11 to 1.2 8.2 h=10.4
climb 0 8.25 h=10.4
expect stand 0 11 h=16.9 below=18
at 0 11.5 h=17.6
zone lookout
expect step 9
use flarepost
expect message a ship's horn answers
expect story lockerkey 1
expect step 10
# SILVER 10-26: the ruined house, Walt Pruitt, the climb, Bear Hollow, the secrets
expect hidden cb_rewchest
use cb_machine
expect hidden cb_rewchest
read Caretaker's chalk board
expect step 11
use Walt Pruitt
wait 1
expect step 12
expect hidden cb_lampchest
use Porch lamp 1
use Porch lamp 2
wait 1
expect shown cb_lampchest
open Walt's tackle box
zone cb_trail
expect step 13
zone cb_summit
expect step 14
open Ranger's radio mast box
wait 3
expect story cb_top 1
expect step 15
zone cb_cave
expect step 16
open Bear Hollow chest
wait 3
expect story cb_cave 1
expect step 17
use cb_machine
expect shown cb_rewchest
expect story cb_fixed 1
open Camp loudspeaker reward
wait 3
read Last broadcast
expect step 18
# the secrets: the wreck, the jumps, the set
zone cb_plane
open Floatplane crate
read Ranger's flight card
zone cb_jumps
open Counselors' perch
open Top of the perch
expect hidden cb_setchest
use cb_piece1
use cb_piece2
use cb_piece3
use cb_piece4
use cb_piece5
wait 2
expect shown cb_setchest
open Lost and found box

# Back to cabin 1: her footlocker
open Counselor's footlocker
wait 2
expect done

# The other boxes: the fridge, cabin 2's box, the sunk canoe's box
open Mess hall fridge
open Cabin 2 box
open Sunk canoe's box
